,"subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0160","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0148"}],"interpretation_note":"本傳明言生子或父子，近世所列直接關係與遠祖報稱分存；姓名分姓據傳首司馬氏，不把各人皆補同一出生地。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jinshu001-jun-reported-ang-ancestry","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","predicate":"ancestor","object_person_id":"ifc_pry_e72","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"自卬八世，生征西將軍鈞","lineage":"paternal","source_number":"八","reported_generation_number":8,"generation_distance":null,"ancestry_precision":"reported_generation_formula","adopted_for_family_tree":false},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry","source_id":"s-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001","quote":"宣皇帝諱懿，字仲達，河內溫縣孝敬里人，姓司馬氏。其先出自帝高陽之子重黎，為夏官祝融。歷唐、虞、夏、商，世序其職。及周，以夏官為司馬。其後程伯休父，周宣王時，以世官克平徐方，錫以官族，因而為氏。楚漢間，司馬卬為趙將，與諸侯伐秦。秦亡，立為殷王，都河內。漢以其地為郡，子孫遂家焉。自卬八世，生征西將軍鈞，字叔平。鈞生豫章太守量，字公度。量生潁川太守儁，字元異。儁生京兆尹防，字建公。帝即防之第二子也。少有奇節，聰朗多大略，博學洽聞，伏膺儒教。漢末大亂，常慨然有憂天下心。南陽太守同郡楊俊名知人，見帝，未弱冠，以為非常之器。尚書清河崔琰與帝兄朗善，亦謂朗曰：「君弟聰亮明允，剛斷英特，非子所及也。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0148","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001:m0139"}],"interpretation_note":"保留八世報稱的數值8，不定其計數口徑或補出中間父系。遠祖孤系本批未作近世樹的首選，不因此重用殷王家族根或接上古人物。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","title":"征西將軍","surname":"司馬","ming":"鈞","additional_names":[],"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry","source_id":"s-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-001-sima-near-ancestry:p001","quote":"宣皇帝諱懿，字仲達，河內溫縣孝敬里人，姓司馬氏。其先出自帝高陽之