，伏膺儒教。漢末大亂，常慨然有憂天下心。南陽太守同郡楊俊名知人，<ref>南陽太守同郡楊俊　「南陽」，各本皆作「南郡」。錢大昕《廿二史考異》{{*|以下簡稱考異}}：「魏志俊為南陽太守，非南郡。」今據改。</ref>見帝，未弱冠，以為非常之器。尚書清河崔琰與帝兄朗善，亦謂朗曰：「君弟聰亮明允，剛斷英特，非子所及也。」","raw_quote_sha256":"5575da666f9e169c2b0750e72d4cfc9419bd35cd77758dc9e36bd77c0396ef6b","selected_text_sha256":"c423833b1b98943bb19918e6ed6564f4d5c90ad401b61f8fa4f2fc20abd95026","begin_anchor":"宣皇帝諱懿，字仲達，河內溫縣孝","end_anchor":"明允，剛斷英特，非子所及也。」"}],"removed_apparatus":[{"text_layer":"later_critical_apparatus","source_line":11,"raw_note":"南陽太守同郡楊俊　「南陽」，各本皆作「南郡」。錢大昕《廿二史考異》{{*|以下簡稱考異}}：「魏志俊為南陽太守，非南郡。」今據改。","raw_note_sha256":"513ca7dcf0235998e3ab2871e1ba0f3821ae3c017af3c9a2e3e7a8acff1ed2b3","scope":"digital_note_reports_yangjun_commandery_variant","collated_by_current_agent":false}]}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true},"assembled_identity":{"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","representative_source_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","source_person_ids":["dkn_ge4_286"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":null,"source_assertion_id":null,"connection":null,"assembly_id":"family-sima-jun-near-ancestry","root_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false}}
